# 3D Mechanical Design & Parametric Modeling Portfolio

Welcome to my professional computer-aided design (CAD) repository. This portfolio centers explicitly on high-fidelity 3D parametric modeling, industrial mechanism assemblies, sheet metal structures, and production-ready technical drawings. 

My design philosophy focuses on design intent, clean feature trees, global drafting standards, and ensuring parts are mathematically constrained for seamless manufacturing integration (DFM - Design for Manufacturing).

---

## 🛠️ Design & Engineering Toolset
* **High-End Enterprise CAD:** Dassault Systèmes CATIA V5 (Part Design, Assembly Design, Generative Shape Design / Surfacing)
* **Parametric Solid Modeling:** SolidWorks (Advanced Assemblies, Kinematic Linkages, Weldments, Sheet Metal)
* **Drafting Standards:** Geometric Dimensioning and Tolerancing (GD&T), ISO/ANSI standards, automated Bill of Materials (BOM) creation

